+name (NVIDIA's in BP-8 plain words), only when the two differ. Read time only: snapshots and the history ledger keep the board's name, so
+fingerprints do not change. The app searches `departmentPosted` too.
+
+**App (`public/app.js`):** `resolveOldFilterKeys()` runs once a board has loaded: a link's `l=` value that no posting uses is replaced by
